{-
   An import is scoped to the file that wrote it, seen from inside a body.

   The half `Reject.Scope.yana` cannot assert: every declaration of `resolve/modules/Scoped/` is
   well formed, so the walk reaches the bodies, and `User.yana`'s calls a function that only
   `Writer.yana` imported. Two names in one call, so the report is about the callee rather than
   about the argument having failed first.
-}

import Scoped

fn main() -> Int = here() + there()
